+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 — TodoMVC greenfield build
+
+- Bootstrap complete: `RIGGING.md`, 4 feature files, watchbill authored.
+- Fix applied to `js/app.js`: Cypress acceptance suite reported 4 DOM-detachment failures when toggling/clearing/completing todos.
+  Root cause: `render()` replaced `todoList.innerHTML` wholesale, destroying all `<li>` elements and detaching Cypress DOM references.
+  Fix: surgical DOM updates in the toggle, toggle-all, destroy, and clear-completed event handlers — update only the affected `<li>` nodes directly instead of calling full `render()`.
+- Verification suite: 35/37 pass (2 pre-existing routing-filter failures unrelated to this fix).
+- Pre-existing failures went from 5 to 2 (3 fixed incidentally by surgical DOM updates).
+- No plant-perturbation added: the fix is complete; no residual code path needs future attention.
+- Outbound not yet relevant. After Boatswain custody commit, offer user a summary and outbound options.
